              "value": "Trigger: The melodic squall is targeted by a spell with the auditory trait\n\nThe melodic squall attempts to counteract the spell. If it succeeds, the spell effect is caught in a blast of wind that sweeps it back to its origin, affecting the caster. Targets of the triggering effect other than the melodic squall are still affected normally."
